  "hero_summary_zh": "沉默术士可以改变每次战斗的局势，有他在场，敌人无法自如地施放技能。他挥舞旋刃将敌人粉碎的同时还将夺取他们的智力，让他们永远难以翻身。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Silencer changes the dynamic of every battle when he shuts down the enemy's ability to cast their spells. As he cuts his foes to ribbons with his glaive, he steals their intelligence to add to his own, ensuring his foes are always at a disadvantage.",
